  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizen Security and Justice</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Seguridad Ciudadano y Justicia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation is an integrated program to enhance citizen security and justice through initiatives to build capacity within the criminal justice system (courts and corrections, ) and through delivery of violence prevention measures by NGOs to residents of nine communities in the Kingston Metropolitan Area. The program also provides support for the elaboration of a national strategy to deal with crime and violence over the long term, and intitutional strengthening.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
